Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c890ba9e-0af2-3f0c-bd1f-ebf25c2fdbc9.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
